<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1384492897"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1468053679"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Sad Songs"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ILLENIUM / Said The Sky / Annika Wells"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ASCEND"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:30.423"><div begin="00:07.666" end="03:20.181"><p begin="00:07.666" end="00:12.093" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Told me I shouldn't watch, got in your car, then we were nothing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说我不该再回望</span></p><p begin="00:13.939" end="00:18.698" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">All the nights in your room, shit we got through, left in your dust, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">共度的深夜 那些风雨同舟</span></p><p begin="00:20.664" end="00:22.618" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Don't know what you got, but I thought we had it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不明白你追寻什么 我曾以为我们拥有全部</span></p><p begin="00:22.618" end="00:26.099" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Now I'm supposed to act like it doesn't matter<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在的我只能强装表现无事发生</span></p><p begin="00:27.113" end="00:32.144" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">But I'm writin' it down, gettin' it out, here's to me hopin'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我写下这些旋律 让心事流淌</span></p><p begin="00:33.501" end="00:37.852" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Someday I'll come home<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终有一日我将归来</span></p><p begin="00:37.852" end="00:40.149" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">And feel like no one's even gone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恍若无人曾离开</span></p><p begin="00:40.149" end="00:43.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Play this at my shows<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在演唱会上弹起这首歌</span></p><p begin="00:43.570" end="00:46.673" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">And know that I've been movin' on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">证明我已开始新的生活</span></p><p begin="00:46.673" end="00:50.301" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Someday I'll go to bed and I'll forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终有一日我会入睡</span></p><p begin="00:50.301" end="00:52.757" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">I'm lyin' in your spot<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忘记此刻正躺在你曾睡的位置</span></p><p begin="00:52.757" end="00:57.774" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">But until someday comes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但在那日来临之前</span></p><p begin="00:57.774" end="01:01.364" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">I'll be writin' sad songs</p><p begin="01:07.333" end="01:12.516" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Wish that there was a way I could have saved one little moment, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">多希望能有方法将过往珍藏</span></p><p begin="01:13.824" end="01:18.302" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">Pull it out when I can, handle the pain, and know when it's over<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">待我能够承受这痛楚时再回望</span></p><p begin="01:20.041" end="01:22.817" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">I was so intact on the night I met you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">初遇那夜我仍完整无伤</span></p><p begin="01:22.817" end="01:25.881" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">Now I'm makin' sad songs inside my bedroom<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今独居一室谱写忧伤</span></p><p begin="01:25.881" end="01:31.514" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">But I'm writin' it down, gettin' it out, here's to me hopin'</p><p begin="01:33.389" end="01:36.625" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Someday I'll come home<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终有一天我会回到家中</span></p><p begin="01:36.625" end="01:39.510" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">And feel like no one's even gone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恍若无人曾离开</span></p><p begin="01:39.510" end="01:43.201" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Play this at my shows<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在演唱会上弹起这首歌</span></p><p begin="01:43.201" end="01:46.878" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">And know that I've been movin' on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">证明我已开始新的生活</span></p><p begin="01:46.878" end="01:50.014" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Someday I'll go to bed and I'll forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终有一天躺上床榻时</span></p><p begin="01:50.014" end="01:52.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">I'm lyin' in your spot<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会忘记正躺在你睡过的位置</span></p><p begin="01:52.670" end="01:57.688" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">But until someday comes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但在那日来临之前</span></p><p begin="01:58.937" end="02:01.037" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">I'll be writin' sad songs<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍会写着悲伤的歌</span></p><p begin="02:05.588" end="02:07.819" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">I'll be writin' sad songs<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍会写着悲伤的歌</span></p><p begin="02:11.769" end="02:15.167" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">I'll be writin' sad songs<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍会写着悲伤的歌</span></p><p begin="02:18.909" end="02:21.808" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">I'll be writin' sad songs<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将谱写忧伤的旋律 忧伤的旋律</span></p><p begin="02:25.155" end="02:27.355" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">I'll be writin' sad songs<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍会写着悲伤的歌</span></p><p begin="02:38.864" end="02:41.354" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I'll be writin' sad songs<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍会写着悲伤的歌</span></p><p begin="02:52.963" end="02:56.163" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">Someday I'll come home<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终有一日我将归来</span></p><p begin="02:56.163" end="02:58.843" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">And feel like no one's even gone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恍若无人曾离开</span></p><p begin="02:58.843" end="03:02.788" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">Play this at my shows<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在演唱会上弹起这首歌</span></p><p begin="03:02.788" end="03:05.614" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">And know that I've been movin' on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">证明我已开始新的生活</span></p><p begin="03:05.614" end="03:09.421" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Someday I'll go to bed and I'll forget<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终有一日我会入睡</span></p><p begin="03:09.421" end="03:12.122" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">I'm lyin' in your spot<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忘记此刻正躺在你曾睡的位置</span></p><p begin="03:12.122" end="03:17.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">But until someday comes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但在那日来临之前</span></p><p begin="03:18.343" end="03:20.181" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">I'll be writin' sad songs<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我仍会写着悲伤的歌</span></p></div></body></tt>